  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In this acid base Titrating there is no use of Bunsen burner and measuring cylinder other laboratory equipments will be required for getting the end point of titration.</p><p>These are the equipment required for titration.</p><ul>\t<li>Burette</li>\t<li>Conical flask</li>\t<li>Beaker</li>\t<li>Pipette</li>\t<li>Stirring rod</li>\t<li>Small (filter) funnel</li>\t<li>Burette stand and clamp (note 2)</li>\t<li>White tile&nbsp;</li>\t<li>Indicator</li></ul>",
